			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"鯨井椛"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 726620101,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們來看！我又翻了一遍父親的航海日誌。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620102,
					"content": "裡面有一份附錄，提到了他們曾經開發過的特殊魚餌配方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620103,
					"content": "他們遇見「海中月」那次，使用了一種混合了海草與魔晶礦的特殊魚餌。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620104,
					"content": "如果我們也能做出這個，或許能夠吸引到「海中月」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620105,
					"content": "海草我倒是有很多，只是魔晶礦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620106,
					"content": "別擔心，我這裡有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726620107,
					"content": "欸？真的嗎？是在荒海那邊開採的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620108,
					"content": "父親的日誌中有提到，魔晶礦一定要在荒海那邊的廢墟裡發掘。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620109,
					"content": "雖然不清楚和普通的魔晶礦有什麼區別，但是既然已經決定要這麼做了，我們還是嚴謹一些，遵循書訓比較好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620110,
					"content": "說起來，荒海那邊有很多魔物，很危險。我們去冒險家協會掛一個委託吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620111,
					"content": "不用，我來搞定。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726620112,
					"content": "#啊…對了，我都忘了{F#妳}{M#你}本來就是個強大的冒險家了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620113,
					"content": "#有{F#妳}{M#你}幫忙實在是太幸運了，那就拜託{F#妳}{M#你}了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620114,
					"content": "我先回去取一些製餌工具，稍後我們在荒海西側的沙灘那會合吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7266202,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7266204
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7266204",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7266204,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"鯨井椛",
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 726620201,
					"content": "這麼快就找到了嗎？不愧是強大的冒險家啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620202,
					"content": "這些夠嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726620203,
					"content": "嗯，接下來看我的吧，只要這樣…這樣…再這樣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620204,
					"content": "做好了，就是這些了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620205,
					"content": "接下來要做的就是把魚餌撒下去，然後等著「海中月」出現了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620206,
					"content": "嗯，我特意選了這個地方，當年我們就是從這裡上岸的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620207,
					"content": "那條指引我們返航的「海中月」，也是在這裡消失的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620208,
					"content": "所以，大家準備好了嗎？見到「海中月」可別忘了許願哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620209,
					"content": "如果沒有成功怎麼辦？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 726620210,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620211,
					"content": "別說喪氣話，會成功的，「海中月」一定會來的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620212,
					"content": "嗯！會成功的！大魚大魚，你一定要乖乖上鉤呀！拜託你了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620213,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們看！{F#妳}{M#你}們快看！水下在發光！有什麼過來了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鯨井椛"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620214,
					"content": "真的嗎？真的是「海中月」來了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620215,
					"content": "嗚哇——遺蹟守衛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726620216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 726620216,
					"content": "怎麼會是這傢伙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7266203,
